## Implement entity SHACL facets (Explorer popup, panel, ring + MCP tool)
================================================================================

Context:
Implementation of `.planning/entity-shacl-facets/SPEC.md` against the
test-first contracts above. One entity is checked against every enabled SHACL
shape on its class, its ancestors and the whole graph, as entity-scoped SQL.
Surfaces: Graph Explorer right-click menu, detail-panel section, popup and
canvas ring; MCP tool `check_entity_shacl_facets`; REST `/nodes/shacl`.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeShaclService.py
   New. Shape selection (own class, `parent` lineage, global), inherited
   shapes re-targeted to the entity's own class URI, one `UNION ALL` batch
   filtered on the entity with a per-shape fallback, five statuses, observed
   values (20-value cap), summary. An unreadable graph (never built) raises
   InfrastructureError with the engine message instead of a 500.
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeShaclResponse.py
   New. Pydantic response contract of `/nodes/shacl` (own file: the router is
   capped by the class-per-file ratchet).
3. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/__init__.py, src/back/objects/digitaltwin/__init__.py
   Export NodeShaclService and NodeShaclResponse.
4. src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py, src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   New `GET /api/v1/digitaltwin/nodes/shacl` (registry domain, public graph
   read check) and `GET /dtwin/nodes/shacl` (session domain, graph read
   check); `shacl_shape_count` on NodeContextResponse.
5. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/node/NodeContextService.py, src/api/routers/domains.py
   `shacl_shape_count` on `/nodes/context` and per class on
   `/api/v1/domain/classes`.
6. src/back/core/mcp_tools.py, src/mcp-server/server/constants.py, src/mcp-server/server/app.py
   Catalog entry (graph tool, policy-configurable), GRAPH_TOOLS mirror,
   `API_V1_DT_NODE_SHACL`, re-exports.
7. src/mcp-server/server/tools.py
   `check_entity_shacl_facets` tool (15 tools); hint count cleared when the
   policy disables the tool. Extracted `_http_error_message` (four identical
   HTTP-error blocks) and `_register_shacl_tool` to keep `register_tools`
   within its size budget.
8. src/mcp-server/server/formatting.py
   `_format_shacl_facets_response` (never reports unchecked shapes as PASS),
   `SHACL shapes (N)` hint in node and class context blocks; extracted
   `_class_virtual_lines` and `_node_business_rule_lines` to keep both
   context formatters within their size budget.
9. src/front/static/query/js/query-shacl-facets.js, src/front/static/query/css/query-shacl-facets.css,
   src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_shacl_facets_modal.html
   New. Popup (status chips as filters, accordion per category, values,
   inheritance, Re-check, Open Data Quality), per-entity cache with
   `shacl-facets:updated` event, detail-panel section, ring status and
   token-based colours, client-side `shaclShapeCountFor`.
10. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js, src/front/static/query/js/query-loaders.js,
    src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_sigmagraph.html, src/front/templates/dtwin.html
    "Data quality → Check SHACL facets (N)" menu item, detail-panel section,
    ring in `_nodeReducer` before seed / Find-Path highlights, "Quality"
    toolbar toggle, shape counts loaded from `/ontology/dataquality/list`,
    asset wiring.
11. tests/units/dtwin/test_node_shacl_service.py
    Added the unreadable-graph case (regression found while probing the
    local server).
12. tests/units/core/test_mcp_tools_policy.py, examples/mcp_client.py
    Catalog size 10 → 11; curated description for the new tool.
13. tests/units/architecture/baseline.json
    Ratchet tightened (`register_tools` 900 → 882, `resolve_context`
    139 → 138, `_format_class_context_block` 117 → 102,
    `_format_node_context_response` 117 → 103, SettingsService 1400 → 1389).
14. tests/eval/datasets/mcp/entity_shacl_facets.jsonl
    New. 10-example eval dataset (SPEC §7).
15. docs/mcp.md, docs/api.md, docs/architecture.md, docs/user-guide.md,
    docs/sphinx/api/app.objects.digitaltwin.rst, .planning/entity-shacl-facets/SPEC.md
    Tool, endpoint, Explorer feature and Sphinx entries; sign-off status.

